confirms whether they are one person or two, and this table is updated
accordingly.

> **Housekeeping.** `eco-nojin.local` is a reserved `.local` mDNS domain and
> cannot receive mail. Replace it with a deliverable address before using it as
> a contact point on the licence or in package metadata.

