## Third-party code vendored in this repository

| Path | Upstream | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| `lib/openzeppelin-contracts` | OpenZeppelin | MIT |
| `lib/forge-std` | Foundry | MIT / Apache-2.0 |

Both are tracked as git submodules. The OpenZeppelin copy is **stale and
version-mismatched**: `contracts/package.json` declares `^4.9.6` while the
vendored tree is 5.7.0, and several `security/*` import paths do not exist in
version 5. This is one of the five reasons `contracts/` does not compile. See
`reports/ECOCOIN_STRATEGY_FA_2026-09-26.md` §1.2.
